sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Owner
    participant API as API
    participant Obj as Object store
    participant Meta as Metadata
    participant CDN as CDN
    participant V as Viewer
    U->>API: upload
    API-->>U: presigned PUT
    U->>Obj: upload directly
    API->>Meta: record ownership and permissions
    U->>API: share with a viewer
    API->>Meta: grant access
    V->>API: open the file
    API->>Meta: is this viewer allowed?
    alt permitted
        API-->>V: short-lived signed URL
        V->>CDN: fetch
        CDN-->>V: bytes from the edge
    else not permitted
        API-->>V: denied — the check is at the metadata tier, never at the CDN
    end
